    <abstract>
      <?line 15?>

<t>A fixture, not a specification: profile-drift.md with one unanchored sentence
written twice, so neither copy is found in the markdown and each is placed at
its XML line, around the one sentence that is found there: the refusals come
out in XML document order, not in the order of their printed line numbers.</t>
    </abstract>
